The three new tests only use `assertContains` and `assertNotContains`, so they still pass if the parser emits extra unintended paths. The existing tests in this class compare the full list with `assertSame` after sorting. Please do the same here, for example for the fallback case:

```php
$expected = [
    'product.cover.media',
    'product.cover.media.mediaFolder.name',
    'product.manufacturer.media',
    'product.manufacturer.media.mediaFolder.name',
];
sort($variables);
static::assertSame($expected, $variables);
```
